        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Hard rule 1 (CLAUDE.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No offsets, Address Library IDs, vtable indices, RVAs, or function signatures from memory. Ever. Sources, in this order: CommonLibSSE-NG headers in this tree, addrlib/, Ghidra via MCP. If none has it, the task becomes &quot;RE this&quot;, not &quot;guess this&quot;. lab/hooks/post-edit.sh catches the literal case: it warns on a hex literal of six or more digits in a .cpp, .h or .hpp file with no REL::ID, REL::Offset or addrlib: marker on its line." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:61-65 (Hard rules 1); lab/hooks/post-edit.sh:12-21" id="re1-rule1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="105" width="590" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Hard rule 2 (CLAUDE.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Decompiler output is a hypothesis. Every inferred side effect is tagged HYPOTHESIS in the verb doc until a lab run or a Frida trace confirms it. A verb is done at T3 with a green scenario and no HYPOTHESIS tags left. Workflow 3: the re-analyst returns hypotheses; you file them." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:66-67 (Hard rules 2), :100-101 (Workflow per verb 3), :155 (Testing tiers)" id="re1-rule2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="620" y="105" width="590" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1. CommonLibSSE-NG headers&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:61-65 (Hard rules 1: the first source)" id="re1-col1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="206" width="330" height="639" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;CommonLibSSE-NG/ in this tree&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A submodule at CharmedBaryon/CommonLibSSE-NG b93280e8 (2024-09-03): the commit skymp's vcpkg overlay port builds the client against. The engine map: classes, vtables, REL::ID. Never modified; repinned only when the port moves." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:47-51 (Workspace layout); CommonLibSSE-NG git log -1 (b93280e8, 2024-09-03)" id="re1-a1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col1">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="33" width="310" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;What a header gives&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Members with offset comments: ActiveEffect's spell // 40, target // 50, magnitude // 78, castingSource // 88 (A/ActiveEffect.h:102-115)&lt;br&gt;• Vtable slots as comments, some with a body: ValueModifierEffect's Update // 04 (V/ValueModifierEffect.h:16), GetAllowMultipleCastingSourceStacking // 11 - { return 1; } (:18), ModifyActorValue // 20 (:36)&lt;br&gt;• Ids: RELOCATION_ID(se, ae) and REL::VariantID(se, ae, vr) in include/RE/Offsets.h, Offsets_VTABLE.h, Offsets_RTTI.h; UIMessageQueue::AddMessage is RELOCATION_ID(13530, 13631) (Offsets.h:569)" tooltip="Source: CommonLibSSE-NG include/RE/A/ActiveEffect.h:102-115; include/RE/V/ValueModifierEffect.h:16, :18, :36; include/RE/Offsets.h:569; include/RE/Offsets_VTABLE.h:1953" id="re1-a2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col1">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="139" width="310" height="160" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The answer: file:line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Workflow 3: if CommonLib has the symbol, cite file:line in the verb doc. A body in a comment is still a reading: spell-cast.md's dual-cast HYPOTHESIS leaned on ValueModifierEffect's { return 1; } against ActiveEffect's { return 0; } (A/ActiveEffect.h:79) until effect-stack-trace.js measured it (page 3)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:100-101 (Workflow per verb 3); docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:513-519; lab/frida/effect-stack-trace.js:1-11" id="re1-a3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col1">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="329" width="310" height="110" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re1-a3-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;HYPOTHESIS&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re1-a3">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="90" width="73" height="15" as="geometry" />
