        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;From the Mac&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GHIDRA_MCP_URL https://ghidra.gaussing.tv/mcp, Caddy to sky-re:8080: the ghidra server of .mcp.json.&lt;br&gt;• just ghidra: an MCP initialize; prints the server's name and version&lt;br&gt;• just ghidra-import &amp;lt;exe&amp;gt;: analyzeHeadless inside sky-re as a transient unit, pyghidra-mcp stopped around it&lt;br&gt;• just ghidra-query &amp;lt;program&amp;gt; decompile | xrefs | bytes &amp;lt;addr&amp;gt;: headless GhidraQuery.java, no MCP in the loop (the MCP server indexes the whole binary before its first answer)" tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:108-109; .mcp.json; justfile:69-92 (ghidra, ghidra-import, ghidra-query); lab/tools/ghidra-query.sh; lab/tools/GhidraQuery.java:1-6" id="re1-c2">
