        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sky-re, LXC 701, 10.10.70.11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ghidra 12.1.4, JDK 21 and pyghidra-mcp, serving one project on rpool/sky/persist over streamable HTTP, one program per exe: SkyrimSE-1.7.104.0.exe (imported 2026-09-29) and SkyrimSE-1.6.1170.0.exe (2026-10-04, from Steam's depot). CommonLib's names reach a program through just relid; its RTTI analyzer names classes and vtables from the binary. Powered on demand." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:54 (Guests), :73-85 (sky-re)" id="re1-c1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col3">
