        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Analysis runs only on sky-re&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ghidra, objdump, anything that reads the exe: never on the Proxmox host, not even read-only; the hypervisor is the estate's root of trust (2026-10-05). If pyghidra-mcp does not answer, stop and report; thuum-mundus brings sky-re up. Eli's rule: sky-re is down while both clients run." tooltip="Source: memory feedback-re-on-sky-re.md (2026-10-05, 2026-10-09); docs/LAB.md:604-605" id="re1-c3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col3">
