        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;A read in the other program&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Poison's static read (2026-10-12) was made in 1.7.104's bodies under the same Address Library ids: the 1.6.1170 program is still SteamStub-wrapped at rest, though its unwrapped sections agree on every function size checked. Every step stayed HYPOTHESIS until a Frida trace on 1.6.1170 (page 3)." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:41-47; lab/frida/poison-trace.js:1-4" id="re1-c4">
