        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The re-analyst subagent&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: .claude/agents/re-analyst.md; CLAUDE.md:100-101" id="re1-col4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1106" y="206" width="330" height="639" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;.claude/agents/re-analyst.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;For an engine surface still UNKNOWN or a side effect untagged. It reads and never writes source.&lt;br&gt;1. CommonLibSSE-NG headers first: a symbol there is answered with file:line, and it stops.&lt;br&gt;2. Otherwise the Ghidra MCP: strings and symbols, decompile the candidates, cross-references one level up and one down; rename only what it can prove.&lt;br&gt;3. Cross-check any address against addrlib/ for 1.6.1170; report the Address Library ID, never a raw RVA.&lt;br&gt;4. TiltedEvolution only for which function it hooks (rule 7, ADR-005)." tooltip="Source: .claude/agents/re-analyst.md:1-21; CLAUDE.md:76-77 (Hard rules 7), :100-101 (Workflow per verb 3)" id="re1-d1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col4">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="33" width="310" height="160" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Its whole answer: a hypothesis block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;## Hypothesis: &amp;lt;verb&amp;gt; / &amp;lt;question&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;• Candidate: a CommonLib name or an Address Library ID (confidence low, med or high)&lt;br&gt;• Evidence: strings, xrefs, CommonLib neighbors, callers&lt;br&gt;• Side effects (HYPOTHESIS)&lt;br&gt;• Suggested Frida trace: functions, args, the scenario step&lt;br&gt;• What would falsify this&lt;br&gt;Every address tagged HYPOTHESIS; nothing from memory; a tie returns both. The main session files it in the verb doc." tooltip="Source: .claude/agents/re-analyst.md:23-33; CLAUDE.md:100-101 (Workflow per verb 3)" id="re1-d2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col4">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="223" width="310" height="158" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re1-d2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;HYPOTHESIS&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re1-d2">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="138" width="73" height="15" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Game records: lab/esm.py&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: lab/esm.py:2-8 (rule 1 in spirit)" id="re1-col5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re1-1">
