        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Master files on sky-srv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/srv/persist/esm for 1.7.104 and /srv/persist/esm/1.6.1170 for 1.6.1170 (ESM_DIR), from rpool/sky/persist. Licensed files never leave rpool/sky." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:359-363 (Game versions: Server); lab/esm.py:6-8" id="re1-e1">
