        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab/esm.py, run on sky-srv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reads a TES4 plugin's records by editor id, after UESP's Mod File Format: find, near, ref, id, races, attacks. The server's validators take game numbers from the master files, never from memory (rule 1 in spirit)." tooltip="Source: lab/esm.py:2-35" id="re1-e2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col5">
