        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Read for dual casting (2026-10-12)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flames' damage, MGEF 0x13CA9: a Value Modifier on Health (DATA EffectType 0, PrimaryAV 24). With a school's dual-casting perk (entry point 75) one overcharged cast: fMagicDualCastingEffectivenessBase 2.2 (GMST 0x361F6), fMagicDualCastingCostMult 2.8 (0x361F4). Without it, UESP: the same effectiveness as though cast normally, but twice." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:499-519" id="re1-e3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re1-col5">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="243" width="310" height="100" as="geometry" />
