        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Hard rule 8 (CLAUDE.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blocked on in-game behavior: write the Dynamic section of the verb doc (Frida script or breakpoint plan plus expected observations) and stop. Do not guess and do not loop on it. Workflow 7: still unconfirmed after one lab run, hand the Dynamic plan to Eli and wait." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:78-80 (Hard rules 8), :110 (Workflow per verb 7)" id="re2-rule8">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="105" width="386" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;ADR-004: Frida for the agent, x64dbg for humans&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Frida scripts that hook by Address Library ID and log to jsonl can be written by the agent from a verb doc and run by the scenario runner unattended. Human breakpoint sessions are reserved for questions that need eyes." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:51-58 (ADR-004)" id="re2-adr4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="421" y="105" width="386" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;ADR-009 and hard rule 13&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The scenario runner is the only thing that marks green; neither the agent nor a human marks a verb done by hand. Scenario YAML goes in commits of its own that Eli reviews; never turn a scenario green by weakening its assertions." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009); CLAUDE.md:90-92 (Hard rules 13)" id="re2-adr9">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="822" y="105" width="388" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The verb doc's Dynamic plan (docs/VERB.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filled while any tag is HYPOTHESIS: the Frida script, lab/frida/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.js (functions by Address Library ID, the args and return values to log, the scenario step that triggers them), or a breakpoint plan for a human session (function, condition, what to watch, the value that holds and the one that falsifies). Owner: agent (Frida) or Eli (x64dbg)." tooltip="Source: docs/VERB.md:77-83; docs/LAB.md:591-602 (Dynamic RE lane)" id="re2-m0">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="210" width="520" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;A probe: x-&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.yaml, run by path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;just lab-run &amp;lt;path&amp;gt;: an exploratory x- probe, which never lives in lab/scenarios (ADR-009). One question each, kept in the session's scratchpad: x-dual-stack, x-reteach-probe, x-poison-probe3 to 6. With no assertions, green only says every step ran." tooltip="Source: justfile:150-154 (lab-run); session scratchpad x-*.yaml; lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:162 (verdict)" id="re2-p1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=12;boundedLbl=1;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="210" width="560" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;A scenario: lab/scenarios/&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;.yaml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The T3 proof of a verb (smoke-, m0-, a-, b- and one t2-). Its own commit, which Eli reviews; CI refuses a commit that mixes scenario YAML with other files. b-poison went green twice by path, then was committed alone (de09fdc), awaiting review." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:90-92; docs/LAB.md:568-571; lab/README.md (scenarios); git log de09fdc" id="re2-p2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=12;boundedLbl=1;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="294" width="560" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;One run: just lab-run &amp;lt;scenario or path&amp;gt; [game]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;POST /lab/run; the run id is &amp;lt;UTC stamp&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;scenario id&amp;gt;. The server's world/ comes back from the scenario's snapshot, the clients are rolled back and started, and each SkyrimSE.exe's version is checked. Then the steps in order: client steps through lab-driver (GET /lab/step), server steps through the gamemode's labCommand, and screenshot, relaunch and frida by lab-api itself; then the assertions, the artifacts and result.json. The exit code is the verdict: green, red or error." tooltip="Source: justfile:154-195 (lab-run); lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:110-170, :480-495; lab/labapi/labapi/scenario.py:15-27; docs/LAB.md:520-552" id="re2-r1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1180" y="210" width="620" height="148" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
