        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;At a step: frida {script, params}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- c2: frida {script: poison-trace.js, params: {ANSWER_YES: true}}. With params, _frida_start writes uploads/&amp;lt;stem&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;.js with globalThis.LAB_PARAMS = {...}; prepended (thuum d857159, 2026-10-12)." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:701-739; lab/scenarios/b-poison.yaml:38; git log d857159" id="re2-m1b">
