          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab-api serves the script&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /lab/frida/scripts/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;, from lab/frida and then its uploads; the clients pull it inside the VLAN from http://10.10.70.10/lab." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/app.py:246-254; lab/labapi/labapi/config.py:95-96" id="re2-m2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="526" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;A guest exec starts the watcher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through the Proxmox guest agent, PowerShell downloads the script to C:\sky-lab\frida\&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;, writes C:\sky-lab\run.ps1 and starts the sky-lab-run task: the injector must run in the lab user's session, the game's (as SYSTEM it &quot;refused to load frida-agent&quot;, 2026-10-05)." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/config.py:113-129; lab/frida/README.md:13-15" id="re2-m3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="608" width="560" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;run.ps1 attaches frida-inject&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;It waits for SkyrimSE, then five seconds more (attaching at process start once never loaded the agent), and runs frida-inject.exe -p &amp;lt;pid&amp;gt; -s &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;, stdout to C:\sky-lab\frida\&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.out. frida-inject 17.19.0 for Windows x86_64 is staged in C:\sky-lab\frida by just client-frida &amp;lt;vmid&amp;gt;, its SHA-256 checked." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/config.py:122-127; lab/frida/README.md:5-12; lab/tools/client-frida.sh; justfile:385-386 (client-frida)" id="re2-m4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="702" width="560" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The script inside SkyrimSE.exe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An engine script picks its offsets by the exe's file version or refuses; each hooks with Interceptor.attach and prints JSON lines to stdout (console.log). Hooks do not fire for calls made inside another hook (x-poison-probe3). A script that walked the stack on every memory commit never reported: hook rarer functions, or sample." tooltip="Source: lab/frida/README.md:17-19, :93-95; docs/verbs/poison.md:220-233; lab/frida/effect-stack-trace.js:86-91" id="re2-m5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="796" width="560" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Collected with the run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;At the artifacts phase _frida_trace copies each .out with a read that shares write access (the injector still holds it) and keeps frida/&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;.jsonl; a trace started outside a run is fetched before the next rollback as frida/&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;.before-run.jsonl. A trace ends with the game: never kill frida-inject under a running game (2026-10-05: sky-c1 crashed ten minutes later in frida-agent.dll_unloaded)." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:402-413, :802-804, :840-864; lab/frida/README.md:86-93" id="re2-m6">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="890" width="560" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab-driver.js in the game: the observing steps&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: lab/driver/src/index.ts; docs/LAB.md:381-436" id="re2-colc">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1180" y="404" width="620" height="433" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="A Skyrim Platform plugin: polls lab-api every tick, runs each step on an update, posts its result; the answer rides in the step's note." tooltip="Source: lab/driver/README.md; lab/driver/src/index.ts; docs/LAB.md:381" id="re2-w0">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="6" y="33" width="608" height="28" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;watch-start, watch-stop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From one to the other the client follows every actor near it each frame. A figure: first and last position, maxDisplacement, its largest move between two frames and when (maxStep, maxStepMs), health and magicka on change, its stagger, recoil, shout, bow, arrow, sneak, MRh_, MLh_ and BeginCast events with 1 if its graph took the event, and the graph bools named.&lt;br&gt;self, the player's own side, stamped in ms since watch-start: magicka and health, each animation event sent to its graph, each spell cast, each hit dealt as [ms, target, source, projectile, flags: power 1, sneak 2, bash 4, blocked 8], each hit taken, each magic effect applied." tooltip="Source: lab/driver/src/index.ts:165-214 (Watched, WatchedSelf), :382-441 (trackWatch), :443-498 (events), :1349-1384; git log ef3f95a, b915f1b; docs/LAB.md:411-424" id="re2-w1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="63" width="600" height="100" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;dump-state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The player's own state: position and angle, health, magicka, stamina, down, the controls enabled, the menus open, the hands, the game time, and the actors near it with their distance." tooltip="Source: lab/driver/src/index.ts:514-560 (dumpState), :257-272 (time globals); docs/LAB.md:390-391" id="re2-w2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="173" width="600" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;console {text, match}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A line typed into the game's own console a key at a time (Input.TapKey); the note carries every line the console printed in the next 2.5 s, the server's ConsoleOutput included, and with match the last 20 matching lines since the game started, where skymp5-client's logError and logTrace go." tooltip="Source: lab/driver/src/index.ts:1495-1523, :740-748, :1669-1672; docs/LAB.md:428-436; memory skyrim-platform-native-rules.md" id="re2-w3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="235" width="600" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;known {ids}, poisons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;known: an ingredient's known effects as a mask, bit i for effect i, and 1 for a word of power that game has unlocked. poisons: each poisoned stack in the inventory as the game keeps it: the item, the poison, its count, worn right or left." tooltip="Source: lab/driver/src/index.ts:811-836 (known), :932-954 (poisons); docs/LAB.md:424-428" id="re2-w4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="309" width="600" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;screenshot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A guest exec on a managed client, kept as screenshots/&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;.png (request-screenshot in the game is the fallback). One to three seconds each through the guest agent: too slow to time a one-second stream, which is why the watch stamps ms." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:741-768; docs/LAB.md:450-451; docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:312-313; lab/driver/src/index.ts:189-192" id="re2-w5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-colc">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="371" width="600" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab-api's assertions over the answers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each client step's answer is its note in result.json, cut at 800 characters and kept whole in steps/. The assertions read the server and the clients' last answers: server.actor(c), server.inventory(c), server.effects(c); c.state, c.sees(other), c.view(other); c.watched(other) (maxDisplacement, samples, drainMs, took('staggerStart'), sent(), ever()); c.watched_self() (saw(), ever()); c.known(id), c.poison(id), c.marker(id), c.favorite(id), c.projectile(id); and form(&quot;File.esm:EditorID&quot;) through the item table." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:476-514; lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:262-276; lab/labapi/labapi/assertions.py" id="re2-asrt">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1180" y="873" width="620" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;/srv/lab/results/&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;/ on sky-srv, browsed at https://thuum.gaussing.tv/results/&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;result.json (phases, each step with the brief of its answer, failures, artifacts, notes); steps/&amp;lt;index&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;.json (an answer longer than result.json's 800 characters); server.log (this run's lines alone); c1.log and c1-driver.log (Skyrim Platform's and lab-driver's); screenshots/; frida/&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;.jsonl; on request lab.pcap, world-before/, world-after/ and world-diff. just lab-run keeps result.json as lab/results/&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;.json on the Mac." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:38-41 (_brief), :73-87 (to_result), :262-276, :775-807; lab/labapi/labapi/config.py:68; docs/LAB.md:554-558, :106-107; lab/README.md (results/); justfile:154-195" id="re2-s1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="1107" width="1220" height="62" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Read the run (workflow 6), with readers kept in the session scratchpad&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;stack-read.py: effect-stack-trace.js's windows, grouped into phases. vis-read.py: each watch-stop (figures' maxStep and events; the player's hits with their fields), dump-state, the asserts, the frida lines and the server's cast, hit and shout lines. read-dumps.py: the newest run's dump-state and watch-stop files, over ssh to sky-srv. crouch-read.py: the player's own SneakStart and SneakStop against the figure's, on two clocks." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:107-109 (Workflow per verb 6); session scratchpad stack-read.py, vis-read.py, read-dumps.py, crouch-read.py" id="re2-q">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="580" y="1215" width="560" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
