        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;A fix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;On a fork branch, inside-out: server logic and T0, the message and validator, the hook, the TS handler; T2; then a probe on the new build and a scenario." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:102-106 (Workflow per verb 4, 5); memory thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md" id="re2-o3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re2-outc">
