        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The shape every loop took&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Static first (hard rule 1), as a lead only (rule 2); then a probe run by path, with a Frida script beside it or at one of its steps (rule 8, ADR-004); the verb doc records CONFIRMED with the run id or keeps the HYPOTHESIS; a fix goes on a fork branch; a probe on the new build, then a scenario, checks it (ADR-009)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:61-67, :78-80, :94-111; docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-004, ADR-009; docs/LAB.md:587-605" id="re3-key">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-1">
