        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;4 Fix, fork m2-visuals&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: skymp git log m2-visuals; docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:537-556; memory thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md" id="re3-a4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-la">
            <mxGeometry x="919" y="44" width="261.6667" height="212" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;wire-rules casts, 1abfda55&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;With a stream of one spell in each hand, a hit claims the stream whose last counted hit is oldest, so each hand's stream counts its own time; a hand that misses lets the other count at most a tick more (MAX_TICK_MS)." tooltip="Source: skymp git log m2-visuals 1abfda55 (2026-10-12 23:39 PDT); docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:551-556" id="re3-a4r">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7EE;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="re3-a4">
            <mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="245.6667" height="88" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;skymp5-client hitService.ts, 7da7210f&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A magic hit's double is dropped by frame, not by the caster's last 100 ms: every other copy of one caster, target and spell within a frame. Two hands landing in one frame count twice." tooltip="Source: skymp git log m2-visuals 7da7210f (2026-10-12 23:47 PDT); docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:537-550" id="re3-a4c">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="re3-a4">
            <mxGeometry x="8" y="124" width="245.6667" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;5 Probe x-dual-cast2, run 20261013-072430&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;On m2-visuals 140ed04d's client, the watch now recording each hit's projectile and flags (thuum ef3f95a): a double carries the same target, spell, projectile (0x12FCF) and flags as its original, 0 to 1 ms apart, so nothing but the frame tells them apart, which is what 7da7210f's filter goes by. c2's watch also saw each hand's concentration start reach the figure a frame before its release (237 and 252 ms; 486 and 504 ms)." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:439-454, :537-550; session scratchpad x-dual-cast2.yaml; lab/results/20261013-072430-x-dual-cast2.json; git log ef3f95a" id="re3-a5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-la">
            <mxGeometry x="1210.6667" y="44" width="261.6667" height="212" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6 Probe x-dual-cast3: the damage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Run 20261013-082306 on 31b56fc9: red. Both hands' series reached the server (36 hits) but counted one stream (3.63 s; c2 at 0.728): Skyrim Platform's spellCast event credited the second cast to the right hand, both hands reading as casting. The trace measured the MagicTarget at +0xA0. Fix 0f4e3b75 (the hand that began since the last cast event); its rerun is the third staging's." tooltip="Source: session scratchpad x-dual-cast3.yaml; memory thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md; lab/results (no x-dual-cast3 run as of 2026-10-13)" id="re3-a6">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-la">
