        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;b. The re-teach notice&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md (Playtest fourteen)" id="re3-lb">
          <mxCell style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=34;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="574" width="1780" height="210" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="Playtest fourteen (2026-10-12, Eli, parity ef3fb03c): after a relaunch, the login's re-teach (Actor.AddShout, Game.TeachWord, Game.UnlockWord for every recorded shout and word) showed the game's big learned notice for each. Which call raises it, and how can a game learn a word without it?" tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md:421-425" id="re3-lb-cap">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lb">
            <mxGeometry x="44" y="8" width="1720" height="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1 The static read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A word known and a word unlocked are runtime flags on the word's form, kKnown (1 &amp;lt;&amp;lt; 6) and kUnlocked (1 &amp;lt;&amp;lt; 0) (T/TESForm.h:67, :56): HYPOTHESIS that these are what Game.TeachWord and Game.UnlockWord set. The HUD's messages go through UIMessageQueue::AddMessage, RELOCATION_ID(13530, 13631) (Offsets.h:569); a HUDData carries its type, kWordOfPower1 = 21 (H/HUDData.h:34)." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md:73-76; CommonLibSSE-NG include/RE/T/TESForm.h:56, :67, include/RE/Offsets.h:569, :581, include/RE/H/HUDData.h:34, :53-55" id="re3-b1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lb">
            <mxGeometry x="44" y="44" width="403" height="122" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re3-b1-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;HYPOTHESIS&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-b1">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="102" width="73" height="15" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;2 Frida: hud-trace.js in probe x-reteach-probe, run 20261013-061753&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;On AddMessage (13631) and DebugNotification (52933), with the caller's frames; c1 typed addshout, teachword and unlockword 5 s apart. Only Game.TeachWord raised a HUD message: type 21, 'Fire Breath', at 06:19:53.05, a second after the server's teachword (06:19:51.99); AddShout (06:19:38.8) and UnlockWord (06:20:04.2) raised none. The caller ran from a Papyrus native (NativeFunctionBase::Call, 104651) through ids 55631 and 55500 to the sender 51648, none named in CommonLib." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md:450-458; lab/frida/hud-trace.js; lab/frida/README.md:78-84; session scratchpad x-reteach-probe.yaml; lab/results/20261013-061753-x-reteach-probe.json (frida/c1-hud-trace.js.jsonl)" id="re3-b2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lb">
            <mxGeometry x="483" y="44" width="403" height="122" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re3-b2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;CONFIRMED&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1A1A1A;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-b2">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="102" width="69" height="15" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;3 Fix, fork m2-visuals 140ed04d (server)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A login marks a known word with SKSE's Form.SetPlayerKnows (the form's known flag 0x40: skse64 GameForms.h kFlagPlayerKnows; CommonLib's kKnown), then unlocks it as before; the console's live teachword keeps the game's message (a word learned). NATIVES.md: Form.SetPlayerKnows, R3, sent as an SpSnippet after every login (thuum 5578fdd)." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md:458-462; skymp git log m2-visuals 140ed04d (2026-10-12 23:29 PDT); docs/NATIVES.md:645; git log 5578fdd" id="re3-b3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lb">
            <mxGeometry x="922" y="44" width="403" height="122" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;4 Probe x-reteach2, run 20261013-072218&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;On m2-visuals: c1 recorded Fire Breath and its first word, relaunched, was screenshot at once and a second on, then read the word. Green: the record holds the word unlocked (server.actor(c1).wordsUnlocked == &quot;0x20e17&quot;) and c1's game reads it unlocked (c1.known(0x20e17) == 1). No trace ran, so the notice was checked by screenshot alone (one black, one in play without it), and x-reteach-probe's screenshot after teachword had shown none either, though its trace caught the message." tooltip="Source: session scratchpad x-reteach2.yaml; lab/results/20261013-072218-x-reteach2.json; session scratchpad reteach2/s-007-c1.png, s-009-c1.png and reteach/s-009-c1.png (viewed 2026-10-13)" id="re3-b4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lb">
