        <UserObject label="Still HYPOTHESIS in shouts.md: that the known flag is all TeachWord leaves on the word besides the message (b-shout's relaunch checks the word still reads unlocked). Verb doc: docs/verbs/shouts.md, Playtest fourteen." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/shouts.md:462-464" id="re3-lb-foot">
