        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;c. The poison box&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md (Dynamic plan, Measured)" id="re3-lc">
          <mxCell style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=34;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="808" width="1780" height="312" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="Playtest fourteen (2026-10-12, Eli, parity ef3fb03c): the game's box poisoned the sword, then the sword swung as fists in an unequip and re-equip loop, and the server logged nothing: a poisoning is not an equip event. x-poison-probe2 had found the lab cannot answer the box: neither a tapped Enter nor E put the poison on." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:188-208" id="re3-lc-cap">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lc">
            <mxGeometry x="44" y="8" width="1720" height="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1 Static read: the re-analyst&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;In 1.7.104's bodies under the same ids (page 1): using a poison runs the use switch (38001), whose ALCH case opens the box (40481) and skips the equip event; on Yes the callback (40482) calls InventoryEntryData::PoisonObject (16024) on the right hand's entry, and the PoisonedWeapon event goes out through 41044 from the source 41069. Doses: 1." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:41-61, :209-219" id="re3-c1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lc">
            <mxGeometry x="44" y="44" width="223.4286" height="224" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re3-c1-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;HYPOTHESIS&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-c1">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="204" width="73" height="15" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;2 Frida: poison-trace.js in x-poison-probe3, run 20261013-001004&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Uploaded with ANSWER_YES: on the opener's return, on the game thread, it called the callback with 2, and c2's Steel Sword, worn in the right hand, carried DB03Poison with one dose: CONFIRMED the right hand and one dose without perks. The callback, PoisonObject and the event went unlogged: Frida's hooks do not fire for calls made inside another hook." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:220-233; lab/frida/poison-trace.js; session scratchpad x-poison-probe3.yaml; lab/results/20261013-001004-x-poison-probe3.json (frida/c2-poison-trace-yes.js.jsonl)" id="re3-c2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lc">
            <mxGeometry x="293.4286" y="44" width="223.4286" height="224" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="re3-c2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;CONFIRMED&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1A1A1A;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="re3-c2">
