        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;server, e8c81949&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MpActor::ApplyPoison takes a poison's OnEquip as the right-hand weapon's poisoning: one poison spent, one copy marked with one dose; OnWeaponHit runs the poison on the target and spends the dose." tooltip="Source: skymp git log m2-poison e8c81949 (2026-10-12 17:21 PDT); docs/verbs/poison.md:116-131" id="re3-c3s">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="re3-c3">
            <mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="207.4286" height="100" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;client, 28402bcd&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Skyrim Platform sinks the PoisonedWeapon event (source 41069) and emits poisonApplied; skymp5-client sends it as the poison's OnEquip." tooltip="Source: skymp git log m2-poison 28402bcd (2026-10-12 17:24 PDT); docs/verbs/poison.md:133-143" id="re3-c3c">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="re3-c3">
            <mxGeometry x="8" y="136" width="207.4286" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;4 Probes x-poison-probe4 and 5: the box stays open&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;x-poison-probe4 (20261013-061132), the trace at a scenario step: Yes poisoned the sword and the server marked it, but the box stayed on screen and held c2 in menu mode, so its swing never came; close-menu posts kHide, which MessageBoxMenu ignores. x-poison-probe5 (20261013-062038), no trace: a tapped Enter (28), then E (18), did not answer it." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:256-259; lab/frida/poison-trace.js:16-20; session scratchpad x-poison-probe4.yaml, x-poison-probe5.yaml; lab/results/20261013-061132-x-poison-probe4.json, 20261013-062038-x-poison-probe5.json" id="re3-c4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lc">
            <mxGeometry x="792.2857" y="44" width="223.4286" height="224" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;5 The trace keeps the box shut (thuum ad22fcc)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;With ANSWER_YES, within a second of the opener, AddMessage (13631) asked to show MessageBoxMenu (kShow 1) is asked to force-hide it instead (kForceHide 4, U/UIMessage.h:9-15), which a menu not open ignores." tooltip="Source: lab/frida/poison-trace.js:16-27, :84-98; git log ad22fcc; CommonLibSSE-NG include/RE/U/UIMessage.h:9-15" id="re3-c5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="re3-lc">
            <mxGeometry x="1041.7143" y="44" width="223.4286" height="224" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6 Probe x-poison-probe6, run 20261013-063057&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;End to end on m2-poison 25a6a7ad's client: the box answered and kept shut, the sword poisoned in c2's game, and &quot;MpActor::ApplyPoison ff000001 - poison 58cfb on 13989, 1 dose(s)&quot; on the server. c2's swing hit c1 for 7.42 and the poison ran from the server's mark: c1 at 0.326 ten seconds on (100 less 7.4 and 60); c2's sword clean." tooltip="Source: docs/verbs/poison.md:237-255; session scratchpad x-poison-probe6.yaml; lab/results/20261013-063057-x-poison-probe6.json" id="re3-c6">
