        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;7 Scenario b-poison&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The same frida step: green twice by path (20261013-063530, -063823): the poison off the server's inventory and on c2's sword, c1 at 0.3258 after one swing, the sword clean, a second swing the sword's alone (0.9328). Committed alone (de09fdc), awaiting Eli's review." tooltip="Source: lab/scenarios/b-poison.yaml; lab/results/20261013-063530-b-poison.json, 20261013-063823-b-poison.json; git log de09fdc; docs/verbs/poison.md:275-293" id="re3-c7">
